From 8ccceba60c78245aa012d80bdbc3066593d4833d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sai Krishna Potthuri <sai.krishna.potthuri@amd.com>
Date: Wed, 13 Aug 2025 12:38:39 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 026/190] mmc: sdhci-of-arasan: Increase CD stable timeout to 2
 seconds

commit 1f2078f3796a37356760a9751ecfa62cd5a4ac56 from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

On Xilinx/AMD platforms, the CD stable bit take slightly longer than
one second(about an additional 100ms) to assert after a host
controller reset.
There is no functional failure with one second delay but to ensure
reliable initialization, increase the CD stable timeout to 2 seconds.

Fixes: 6c3270917178 ("mmc: sdhci-of-arasan: Ensure CD logic stabilization before power-up")
Signed-off-by: Sai Krishna Potthuri <sai.krishna.potthuri@amd.com>
Message-ID: <20250813070839.980966-1-sai.krishna.potthuri@amd.com>
State: pending
Signed-off-by: Quanyang Wang <quanyang.wang@windriver.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 drivers/mmc/host/sdhci-of-arasan.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/mmc/host/sdhci-of-arasan.c b/drivers/mmc/host/sdhci-of-arasan.c
index 30daa2db80b1..e20266950254 100644
--- a/drivers/mmc/host/sdhci-of-arasan.c
+++ b/drivers/mmc/host/sdhci-of-arasan.c
@@ -99,7 +99,7 @@
 #define HIWORD_UPDATE(val, mask, shift) \
 		((val) << (shift) | (mask) << ((shift) + 16))
 
-#define CD_STABLE_TIMEOUT_US		1000000
+#define CD_STABLE_TIMEOUT_US		2000000
 #define CD_STABLE_MAX_SLEEP_US		10
 
 /**
